{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The first test pass caught a game-breaking issue in the double-paddle stage: the ball could become trapped between the paddles. I’m correcting the collision rules, then rerunning the full campaign. Controller, touch, pickups, attract mode, and two-page co-op checks passed.\n"}}
