{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"agent_message","text":"All 25 checks passed, including offline `file://` gameplay with network access blocked. Two defects were caught by automated tests and fixed, one of them game-breaking. I’m finishing the credits and exit-interview JSON, plus checking that attract mode preserves an open online room.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('main.js');s=p.read_text()\ns=s.replace(\\\"let toastTime=0,shake=0,\\\", \\\"let attractMenu='',toastTime=0,shake=0,\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"function showTitle(){if(online.isHub)return;\\\", \\\"function showTitle(preserveRoom=false){if(online.isHub)return;\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"mode='solo';online.leave();netMode='solo';hubEnded=false;\\\", \\\"mode='solo';if(\"'!preserveRoom){online.leave();netMode='\"'solo';}hubEnded=false;\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"if(phase==='attract'){showTitle();return true}\\\", \\\"if(phase==='attract'){const keep=attractMenu==='online'&&online.active&&\"'!online.connected;showTitle(keep);if(keep)showOnline();return true}\")\ns=s.replace(\"function startAttract(){hideOverlay();startRun('\"'solo');\\\", \\\"function startAttract(){attractMenu=menuName;hideOverlay();startRun('solo');\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"case'start':startRun();break;case'coop':startRun('coop');\\\", \\\"case'start':if(online.active)online.leave();startRun();break;case'coop':if(online.active)online.leave();startRun('coop');\\\")\ns=s.replace('<div id=\\\"roomDisplay\\\"></div><p id=\\\"networkStatus\\\"', '<div id=\\\"roomDisplay\\\">\"'${online.role==='\"\\\\'host\\\\'&&online.roomCode?\"'`<div class=\"roomcode\">${online.roomCode}</div><button class=\"textbutton\" data-action=\"copycode\">Copy room code</button>`:'\"\\\\'\\\\'}</div><p id=\\\"networkStatus\\\"')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\nnode build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
